window.products.push({"id":843031,"name":"JUMJEE Bedding Comforter Set 3D Pattern Printings Kids and Toddler Duvet Set Including 1 Microfiber Soft Comforter with 2 Pillow Shams","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X9ZAnqebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[SOFT AND COZY] - The comforter set is made of 90gsm polyster microfiber, which makes the surface super soft and comfortable. The filling is Overfilled with 250gsm premium microfiber and Invista fiber which can provide brilliant breathability and cozy feeling, like sleep under a cloud. Lightweight, Noise-Free and more Breathable. [3D PATTERN DESIGN] - We offer you this stylish, elegant and high-quality 3D pattern printings duvet set because we want you to have a special bedroom and home environment.The modern flair will give your life a cool feel every day. [COLD WASH&LOW HEAT DRY] -The classic quilted design keeps it fits the body effectively. With the elegant premium Piped Edges, it not only looks beautiful but also can effectively prevent edge breakage and drop lines. [BEDDING SET & EASY CARE] - 3 packs TWIN size include 1 comforter 66x86 inch, 2 pillow shams 20x26 inch, 3 packs FULL/QUEEN size include: 1 comforter 80x90 inch, 2 pillow shams 20x26 inch. Easy care: Machine wash cold, don't use bleach, tumble dry. [Satisfaction Guarantee] - No matter any concerns you meet,please don't hesitate to contact us ,our team will give the best solution within a short time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X9ZAnqebL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUMJEE","source_asin":"B08JCSS28R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JCSS28R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JCSS28R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":843032,"name":"LINSY LIVING Twin Mattress Topper, 3 Inches Dual Layer Firm Memory Foam for Pressure Relief, Removable and Washable Tencel™ Cover, Adjustable Straps, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":91.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S45Og54iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual Layers & Reversible Firmness: Combines 1 inch supportive firm foam with 2 inch gel memory foam, this queen size mattress topper gives you a balanced firm feeling. It contours your body but won't let you sink in too much. Rejunvate the old mattress by making it firmer. Moreover, if you still feel the topper is soft, you can turn over the memory foam to get a extra firm mattress topper Cooling Gel Swirl memory foam: The top layer of the bed topper twin is gel-infused swirl memory foam, it has thousands of cooling gel beads to regulate your body temperature. The memory foam contours your body, let you have restful sleeps back Luxury Tencel Fabric: What we are always trying hard to do is creating cozy spaces for our customers. That’s why we choose tencel as the cover for this twin mattress topper. TENCEL is a luxury fabric that is often used on high-end products. It gives soft, breathable and cooling touch, makes every sleep a extravagant indulgence Certified Mattress Topper: LINSY LIVING twin memory foam mattress topper not only has the CertiPUR-US certificate( measures for smell, material, performance and durability), but also got the rigorous STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX Certification. It means that every part of our top grade TENCEL textile is harmless for human body, a bed topper you can definitely trust. Removable & Washable Cover: A mattress topper with removable cover can significantly extend the life of your mattress. LINSY LIVING machine washable dual layer twin mattress topper has zippered design, so that you can remove the tencel cover and do the daily maintenance. Skid Resistance Bottom: In the bottom of this mattress topper there are many anti-slip particles, they are designed to increase the friction between our mattress topper twin and your mattress. The straps on 4 corners also helps to keep the mattress topper in place so that you don’t have to change the position of this twin bed topper 10-Year warranty: 30 days trial protects your rights as a consumer. We also provide a 10 years warranty for all of our customers, so if you have any questions or unsatisfied with this hybrid mattress topper, you can contact LINSY LIVING for support, we are 24/7 for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S45Og54iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY LIVING","source_asin":"B0BK9FPGGF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK9FPGGF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK9FPGGF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
