window.products.push({"id":843050,"name":"Made Terra 4-Tier Large Wood Wall Hanging Towel Ladder Rack with Rope, Blanket Ladder for Bathroom, Wall Hanging Kitchen Hand Towels Holder Bar Hanger","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPyb7RmnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE TOWEL LADDER- Our hanging towel ladder is suitable for hanging kitchen towel, bathroom towels, blanket, ties, scarves, belts, quilts, etc. It is a great wall shelf with which you could also hang some small flowers or ornaments. You can choose to hang the rack on walls or let it stand, either way, it is a lovely storage ladder for any space, indoor and outdoor. CHARMING DECORATIVE PIECE - Rustic wood, mid-century design and vintage finish, MadeTerra Wall Hanging Towel Ladder is meant to match various different décor styles, from minimalsim, boho, vintage, mid-century, galvanized to morden décor. This attractive wall storage rack shows a simple and natural chic appearance, adding an retro element to any interior decoration. It is a fashionable alternative to the commonly seen towel rack. STURDY & SIMPLE SETUP - Meticulously made to details, MadeTerra Wooden Towel Ladder is strongly constructed, free from harmful chemicals, strange odor or splinters. It is an item of premium craftsmanship, made to last and benefit your sustainable home for a long time. With the strong rope coming in the set, you simply have to hang it on wall with just 1 nail, no need for multiple drillings. GOOD FOR MOTHER EARTH - MadeTerra rustic towel hanging rack is made of Acacia wood . The plant is locally grown and sutainably harvested. For thousands of years, acacia has been widely used by Vietnamese artisans to make home furniture and accessories. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and indoor plant display solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our Hanging towel ladder, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Phu Xuyen, a village with 400 years of history in acacia handicrafts in Vietnam. With every purchase you make, you are supporting global fair trade and the thriving lives of artisans community.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPyb7RmnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08T9L2HQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T9L2HQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T9L2HQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
