window.products.push({"id":843171,"name":"Podstakannik Russian Metal Glass Holder for Hot Tea/Coffee Drinking Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ce1+sjUaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Traditional Russian tea-glass holder \"podstakannik\", meaning \"pod\" - under and \"stakan\" - glass. It has been traditionally used during travel in railroad cars for tea drinking so as not to hold the hot glass with your bare hands. It has become a status symbol. It's made of material which doesn't rust or stain and is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ce1+sjUaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WORLD GIFTS","source_asin":"B00HW5YD9U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HW5YD9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HW5YD9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
