window.products.push({"id":843173,"name":"Dad Gifts From Daughter | Son | Cutting Board | Christmas | Fathers Day | Men | Grill | BBQ | Funny | Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aT1f-z9hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"★【Unique Custom DAD Gifts Cutting Board】 : ☀ Our specially-customized cup is engraved with funny & meaningful words,and convey your blessings fully. ☀ He will remember your surprise gift while enjoying his cooking/BBQ time. ❤【Strong Corrosion Resistance】❤ : ☀ We used pure solid wood,although the cost was increased,but it will be morestronger resistant to corrosion than the bamboo on the market. ☀ The back side is designed for culinary cutting board usage,cheese or appetizer serving tray. ★【Every dad Needs To Be Affirmed & Cared】★ : ☀ Your dad is the greatest, he cares for everyone in the family.But he also needs to be cared. ☀ He only wants to contribute to the family,so we need to care more about her. ☀ A Great gift to express your love to your dad,which is professionallymade and sturdy, unique and highly decorative. ❤【Really Saving For You】❤ : ☀ Our cutting boards are double-sided! ☀ The engraved side can be displayed as a beautiful piece of kitchen decorand the back of the board can be used for cutting and serving. ☀ Our eco-friendly custom engraved cutting boards are a very unique andfun way to add something new and different to your kitchen. ★【Funny Decor & Practical】★ : ☀ This wooden cutting board measures 8.8\"W x 13.3\"L x 0.7\"H and weighs 1.5lbs. ☀ It provides enough space for vegetable chopping,slicing fruits,cheeses. ☀ Your dad will most likely treasure this one as a kitchen decor and hang it in his kitchen for years to come. ❤【The Best Shopping Service】❤ ☀ Our cutting board are made from pure wooden and are backed by themanufacturer's lifetime indemnify.☀ Special process to ensure that the engrave does not fall after cleaning.☀ We back our wooden cutting board with 100% Money Backensured and prompt, friendly Customer Service, to help you buy with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aT1f-z9hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QUMO","source_asin":"B08JGGMRC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JGGMRC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JGGMRC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":843174,"name":"3 Inch Extra Thick Plush Mattress Topper for Twin Size Bed, 100% 250TC Striped Jacquard Cotton Cover, Down Alternative Microfiber Filling, Elastic Ban","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwPAN6u1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"** PLUSH SUPPORT. With its premium box quilt 3-inch gusset design, our plush mattress topper is generously filled with 1100gsm of soft down alternative microfiber. Soft cushioning offers support to your hips and shoulder during sleep. Encased in quality cotton, it is the ideal complement to a firm latex or memory foam mattress ** BREATHABLE COMFORT. Our 3-inch mattress pad features a unique box quilted fabric with ventilated technology to increase air flow and reduce trapped body heat. Encased in a soft 250TC striped Jacquard cotton cover, experience optimum comfort that feels wonderful night after night. Enjoy a restful sleep like no other ** SLIP-RESISTANT FIT: Our anchor band design with 4 corner elastic straps ensures a secure fit and adapts to mattress depths from 6\" to 22\". This prevents your plush 3-inch mattress topper cover from shifting in the night to offer you consistent comfort. Twin 39\"x75\" x 3\"/Twin XL 39\"x80\" x 3\"/Full 54\"x75\" x 3\"/Queen 60\"x80\" x 3\" /King 78\"x80\" x 3\"/CalKing 72\"x84\" x 3\" ** EASY CARE CONVENIENCE. For best results, tumble dry your 3-inch topper on a low heat before use to fluff up the fibres. To extend its life and reduce the need to wash it, position a mattress protector/ fitted sheet over it. Wash bi-annually in a front loader machine on a cool wash. *Please do not use a top loader machine as the agitators destroy the fibres","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QwPAN6u1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE BEDDING BASKET","source_asin":"B08CRPRWX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CRPRWX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CRPRWX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
