window.products.push({"id":843415,"name":"USB Desk Fan with Ring LED Lantern, Ultra-quiet, 90° Adjustment for Better Cooling, 3 Speeds Portable Mini Powerful Desktop Table Fan, Small Personal ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MagzoTYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multiuse Essential &Perfect Camping Gear】GOODAT Portable Fan is a multi-functional essential which has many different ways to use and is perfectly suitable for Camping. Our Mini fan is built in upgraded brushless motor, which delivers powerful airflow. Our product combines fan, camping Led light and foldable hanging hook, which circulates air evenly, lights up your tent or campsite in darkness to help you see, hung in a tent, a car or on branches using the foldable hanging hook. 【Light Portable 3-Speed Adjustable Fan with Powerful Wind】 The light portable fan has 3 speed settings(low-mid-high) to provide nice air circulation. The extremely lightweight build allows you to take the fan on the go with ease, store it effortlessly, taking little space by saving from taking separated fan and light. 【90° Tilt Fan Head and Bright Led Light to Customize Your Comfort】With 3-speed option and 90° tilt fan head, you’ll always be comfortable and cool. You can place the fan on desk, floor, or hang anywhere you want. The fan head can tilt 90° up or down, it's great to fresh the air and keep you cool. Ultrabright low powered LED light has two settings(high-low) to light up your place nicely and protect your eyes. 【Durable &Large Capacity& Rechargeable Battery Operated USB Fan】—With 7000mAh built-in lithium batteries, our battery fan can last up to 16 hours with fan (low speed), 100 hours with light(low). Guarantee you a cozy outdoor night without worry of battery running out. USB fan also operates via USB cable for easy recharging, which can be connected to laptop, car charger, Power bank and etc. Perfect fan for both indoors and outdoors. 【User-friendly & 12-Month Warranty】GOODAT desk fan gives you coolness with the easiest operation. Fan and light are controlled by separate button, so they can work together or separately. Press the fan power button to change the speed and press the light power button to change the light level. We provide worry-free 12-month warranty and friendly customer service. If you have any dissatisfaction, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MagzoTYwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"goodat","source_asin":"B09ZD8WHSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZD8WHSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZD8WHSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
