window.products.push({"id":843520,"name":"iceagle 33 Ft 100 pcs Crystal Globe String Lights, Fairy String Lights Plug in, 8 Modes with Remote, Decor for Indoor Outdoor Party Wedding Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DZ8q9XANL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【iceagle Globe String Lights】UL Listed Plug in 100 LED 33ft indoor string lights ( 0.94\" per bulb, 3.94\" spacing between bulbs, 5.7 ft lead wire). Multicolor string light is an ideal eye catching to your home decor or party, making the simple life more colors and interesting. 【End-to-end Connectable】These Globe fairy lights are crystal clear, Each end of the fairy lights has a female connector, you can connect up to 5 strands end to end for a larger coverage. Please take off the whole control box and plug of the other strings, keep only one plug, then connect end to end, they can share one plug. Mold the globe string lights into any shape want, to be your own designer. 【8 Lights Modes】These fairy string lights have 8 different flashing modes: combination, in waves, sequential, slo glo, chasing/flash, slow fade, twinkle/flash, steady on. Adjust the lighting modes as decoration lights for Christmas, party, wedding, bedroom, patio, photography, deck, gazebo and other different occasions. 【Memory Function & Remote Timer】Using a wireless remote control, you can easily use it to turn on/off, adjust modes and speed, choose your favorite model. It also provides 6 hours on/18 hours off timing function. And the multi-color globe lights have a memory function. Even if the power is turned off, it can remember the last mode & color it previously set, adding the convenience of use. No Need to manual reset and operate every day. 【Widely Used and Waterproof】Our led fairy string lights is IP65 waterproof rating can weather all kinds of external elements, so you can leave them up all season. Which makes them suitable for indoor or outdoor lighting. Note: the plug is not waterproof, please keep the plug indoor. The twinkle lights create a festive atmosphere. These are the best choice for christmas trees, garlands, bedroom, living room, balcony, garden, patio, tent, awning, hotel, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DZ8q9XANL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iceagle","source_asin":"B08MF7LBY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MF7LBY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MF7LBY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
