window.products.push({"id":843528,"name":"SENEW Custom Canvas Prints with Your Photo, Personalized Pictures Canvas Wall Art for Bedroom, Living Room, Wedding Baby Pet Family Picture Framed Wal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eIeuS6qDL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"KEEPS BEAUTIFUL MEMORIES: Customizing a canvas art is a nice way to keep your beautiful memories and it makes a great canvas wall art for living room and bedroom. Don't worry the print effect, we provide an easy way to preview the picture you upload and what you see is what you get REQUIREMENT FOR IMAGES: A resolution of 75 DPI is needed, digital camera resolution should not be under 4 megapixels, upload your picture in \"JPEG\" file format. After upload the photo, please stretch the picture to cover the whole canvas area, the stretched picture is the front of the canvas you will get, the print wrapped on the picture frame border is the image edge you stretched, please be sure the main image is in the center of the picture. DO NOT LEAVE WHITE BORDER when you stretch photo HIGH QUALITY: Your wall canvas art will be produced using 15 mil. white semi-gloss artist canvas and eco solvent ink to create outstanding sharpness and intense colors without color off. MDF stretcher bars or natural solid wood bars frame features 1.5inches and the canvas is stretched on the frame and it comes with a hanging kit that is ready to hang WIDE APPLICATION: A beautiful canvas print is a great wall art decor for bedroom, living room, dining room, study or any other occasions, and you can customize any style of picture including pet, family, wedding photos, graduation, vacation, art and so on. It will be a wonderful gift for your kids, parents, friends on birthday, Christmas Day, Thanksgiving Day, etc. FAST AND EASY TO CUSTOMIZE: You have ever customized photo prints on Amazon? Try this larger canvas picture for wall following the purchasing steps, and it's made in USA, making it a fast delivery, easy and convenient to get a personalized canvas wall art for bedroom, home, office","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eIeuS6qDL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SENEW","source_asin":"B08881MCMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08881MCMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08881MCMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
