window.products.push({"id":843532,"name":"Bedsure Quilt Set Light Grey Twin Size (68x86 inches) - Flower Petal Design - Soft Microfiber Lightweight Coverlet Bedspread for All Season - 2 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qt7W5v0HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUTSTANDING FEATURES: Deck out with a flower petal design accented with contrasting embroidery stitching, the elegant quilt will refresh your room in a vintage style - Accompanied by lush floral scrolls which add simple sophistication to your decor - Tight seams on the edging will hold up through washing and won't unravel for longer years to use. SIZES & MEASUREMENTS: Twin size (68\"x86\") 2 piece quilt set comes with a quilt and one sham (20\"x26\") - If you need a bedspread that drapes all the way to the floor, you may have a low bed or choose a larger size - If you have a deep pillow-top mattress (that sits up high on a bed frame and box spring), you'll need a bed skirt to cover the sides well. MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE: Perfect coverlet for summer or warmer weather, you can layer it with a blanket/sheet underneath - In the winter, you can add a comforter underneath - Using a quilt solo on your bed in your master room, guest room or vacation homes - If you have night sweats or toss and turn a lot, it is lightweight to move freely at night. HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL: Woven of 100% microfiber cover and filling, this quilt set is soft & \"cottony\" and becomes softer after washing - High quality material features fade, shrink, pilling and stains resistant which will increase its longevity - Easy to clean (NO worry about pet's fur/hairs or scratches), just machine wash cold and dry quickly. WHAT YOU CAN GET: Bedsure 2 Piece Reversible Quilt Set Twin Size - Flower Petal Design - Soft Microfiber Lightweight Coverlet Bedspread for All Season - Light Grey (Includes 1 quilt, 1 sham) .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qt7W5v0HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B07PZCJ81Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZCJ81Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PZCJ81Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":843533,"name":"Henviro Fall Decor Pillow Covers 18x18 Set of 4 Pumpkin Dwarf Farmhouse Decorations Fall Outdoor Pillow Covers Hello Fall Throw Cushion Case Fall Than","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818gJUG9ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDED: 4 pack Fall Decor Pillow Covers, No Insert or Filler. The fall throw pillow covers are 18x18 inches. The beautiful pattern is printed on the fall outdoor pillow covers the front, and on the other side is burlap color. These fall throw pillow covers integrate fall elements, including cute autumn pumpkin leaf and dwarf, perfect for fall and Thanksgiving decorations. Please allow a slight deviation with regards to the size of the case due to hand cutting and sewing. ESSENTIAL FALL DECOR: Henviro fall pillow covers are necessary for your home decorations; The fall throw pillow covers go well with all home decor, perfectly suitable for bedroom, garden, courtyard, sofa, couch, bench, and bed. Delicate patterns and great designs on fall pillowcases will give your house a whole new look. The boho pillowcase is also a great gift when you provide it to your family; Share your GOOD LUCK with your friends or family! No one can turn down a harvest-themed gift. HIGHER QUALITY：The set of 4 fall pillow covers is made of durable cotton linen: extra thick linen, more robust than ordinary linen, soft and skin-friendly, and no fading or abrasion. The comfortable & soft touch makes it more durable and delicate, child and pet friendly, and the throw pillow cases are washable and safe with the machine. These fall pumpkins dwarf pillow cases perfectly match all furniture styles and are the perfect addition to your fall thanksgiving home decor. FASHION DESIGN: Our fall pillow covers are easy to stuff 18 x 18 pillow insert or more minor fillers into (the insert or filler is not included). Invisible zipper design makes the fall outdoor decorative pillows more beautiful and fashionable. The unique pattern design makes these fall pillowcases attractive and symbolizes the fall harvest. Classic maple leaf and pumpkin patterns are printed on these fall pillow covers will create a good thanksgiving harvest holiday atmosphere for your home. PERFECT FALL DECORATIONS FOR HOME: Henviro fall pillow covers are designed for autumn and add thanksgiving festival elements, such as dwarf, pumpkin, maple leaf, and other fall elements. This fall throw pillow cover easily matches other farmhouse or fall decorations and adds more autumn vibes to your bedroom and living room. Use the fall farmhouse pillow covers to decorate your home. Warm and romantic fall with stylish fall pillowcases, this autumn is enough to make people feel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818gJUG9ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Henviro","source_asin":"B0B767RLXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B767RLXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B767RLXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
