window.products.push({"id":843543,"name":"Steinbach Chubby Nutcracker Suite Tchaikovsky Nutcracker Signed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y4JJtGYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What better way to pay tribute to the composer behind the Nutcracker Suite than this Steinbach Chubby Nutcracker Suite Tchaikovsky Signed Nutcracker. Standing 11\" tall, he was introduced in 2006 to be the patriarch of the Nutcracker Suite Series. He is dressed in a brown furry hat and cloak holding a tiny Mouse King just like those featured in the ballet, The Nutcracker Suite.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y4JJtGYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Steinbach","source_asin":"B00O2CBHJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O2CBHJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O2CBHJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
