window.products.push({"id":843577,"name":"ZeiLaHao Rug Grippers, 8 Pcs Over Size Washable Carpet Tape for Area Rugs, Runner Rugs, Kids' Rugs, Outdoor Doormats, Non-Slip Anti Curling Corner Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qICgDGIIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7.87x1.57 inches rug grippers Tape - With a 50% surface increase over the previous generation of rug grippers, it keeps your carpets in your home firmly attached to the floor without curling or slippage. The increased surface area of the carpet tape grips the carpet securely, allowing your family and friends to walk safely without tripping or slipping on the rug. Easy to Install and Use - Please peel off the white sticker labeled “on carpet,” stick this section on the back of the carpet, making sure the carpet and rug grippers are flat. Second, peel off the transparent film labeled “on floor,” place the rug on the floor where you would like it to be secured, step on it with your foot to help it stick to the floor. You can use multiple rug tapes or cut it to your desired length and stick it, keeping the rug firmly on the floor. Durable Material - Made of high-quality environmentally friendly polymer PU, the carpet grabber has the toughness to withstand being washed and dried for reuse. Other rug grippers on the market can damage hardwood floors, but not ours! When you decide to remove the rug grippers, it will not damage your hardwood floors as there will be no leftover residual glue from the carpet tape. Multiple Application Scenarios - Carpet grabbers allow your carpets to be secured in various high-traffic locations, such as the living room, kitchen, dining area, porch, bedroom, hallway, stairway, and even your office space. The rug grippers will hold any carpet tightly, whether it is attached to an area rug, floor mats, or used on linoleum. Our carpet tape is specifically designed to be used on all slick flooring such as hardwood, glass, tile, laminates, or marble. What You Get - 8 pcs of super adhesive rug grippers. Our friendly customer service team will also be ready to provide you with professional guidance and consultation, as well as a worry-free 24-month warranty. Warm reminder: Please ensure that the surfaces the rug tapes will encounter are cleaned of debris before installation; a clean surface provides a solid adhesion of the carpet tape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qICgDGIIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZeiLaHao","source_asin":"B09M68SP6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M68SP6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M68SP6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
