window.products.push({"id":843600,"name":"Westmell 4pcs Wine Opener Set Air Pressure Pump Bottle Opener Cork Remover Wine Accessory Tool Kit with Foil Cutter Wine Pourer and Vacuum Stopper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y668GmjwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"You will get what you pay for! Made by high quality ABS material, teflon needle surface of wine opener treated with food grade and resistance to corrosion. Food Grade Silicone for the wine pourer  🍷 This 4-piece wine set includes foil cutter, wine pourer, vacuum wine stopper and air pump style cork remover.  🍷 Use Foil Cutter to remove the foil top from your wine bottle effortlessly, with a quick turn of the wrist and it's done, leaving your glass bottle looking great, with smooth edges and ready for cork removal.  🍷 Wine Pourer enables you to achieve consistent, non-drip, mess-free pouring from almost every wine bottle.  🍷 Wine Bottle Stopper provides an air-tight seal to prolong and preserve opened bottles of wine. How to remove the cork: 1. Use the foil cutter (included) to remove the foil cap.  2. Insert the needle into the middle of the bottle and make sure the needle has passed through the entire cork, ensure the protective tube on the wine pump.  3. Press the corkscrew to pump air into the bottle by lifting and lowering corkscrews coat, until the cork slides out of the bottle. (Normally 5-10 pumps per bottle)  4. Push the plastic slider sleeve to make the cork away from the corkscrews needle. The Package Includes: 1 x Wine Bottle Air Pump Opener 1 x Foil Cutter 1 x Vacuum Stopper 1 x Aerator Pourer Warm Tips: Do not use this wine opener with plastic corks.  If you can't get the wine vacuum stopper off from the bottle, please wag the stopper from side to side until a little air can get into the bottle, then, it will be took out easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y668GmjwL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WESTMELL","source_asin":"B07N65NFDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N65NFDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N65NFDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
