window.products.push({"id":843943,"name":"IRIS USA WOOZOO Ultrasonic Humidifier - Cool Mist 3L Water Tank, Bedroom Baby Nursery, Adjustable Mist Level, Night Light Function, Whisper Quiet, Run","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518qOPF5wlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With three (3) levels of ultra-fine mist output and a maximum humidification rate of up to 230mL/h, the WOOZOO Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier makes it easy to maintain humidity at an ideal 30% - 50% in your bedroom, living room, office, or any space. Low humidity can cause problems such as dry skin, sinus discomfort, and can increase static electricity build-up. Better air quality makes for better sleep, helps alleviate dry skin, and even helps to keep plants healthy. The large 3. 0-liter capacity tank enables continuous operation without the need to refill. On a full tank, the Ultrasonic Humidifier runs for up to 38 hours on Low, 23 hours on Medium, or 13 hours on High. The unit shuts off automatically when water runs out. Refill and cleanup are a breeze with the top-fill tank design; simply remove the lid on top to directly access the water reservoir. On the Low setting, the Cool Mist Humidifier’s noise output is less than 37db, even quieter than a library! The nonintrusive blue LED ring creates a relaxing atmosphere perfect for sleep, studying, or even working at home or in the office without disturbance. This is the perfect humidifier for babies’ nurseries, children’s rooms, family rooms, living rooms, offices, studies, bedrooms, and anywhere you can think of. Inspired by the Japanese word for vortex, \"uzu\", the IRIS USA WOOZOO series focuses on adjusting and improving air quality with every device. The powerful and convenient WOOZOO Ultrasonic Humidifier offers all the comfort and ease-of-use you need with a straightforward single-button control system. Operation is quick and easy, just push the button and let it work for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518qOPF5wlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IRIS USA","source_asin":"B09HSXQ366","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HSXQ366","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HSXQ366","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":843944,"name":"GMISUN Spice Labels Preprinted, Super Value Pack 380 Waterproof Spice Labels Stickers for Kitchen Organization, Modern Minimalist Label Stickers for S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSFplhHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXCLUSIVE DESIGN SPICE LABELS & EASY TO READ: These minimalist label stickers for spices and herbs are newly designed by GMISUN, which include 380 stickers totally, 336 preprinted round and square spice labels for most common spices(168 for each shape), 36 blank labels, 8 number labels. GMISUN spice stickers can match with any modern or rustic farmhouse-style kitchen spice and herbs. And the simple black text is clear and easy to read, convenient for you to quickly distinguish different spices. WATERPROOF LONG-LASTING SPICE JAR LABELS: Made of high-quality glossy finish material, the spice stickers are waterproof and oil proof, ensures no bubbles and no curling. These spice jar labels resist staining and moisture, so you do not worry to smudge them while cooking. Easy to stick and reapply, these reusable seasoning labels with premium glue can be used for a long time with no pealing. Printed spice labels are helpful for organizing your different spices at the spice rack and kitchen. REUSABLE A TO Z ORDERED SPICE STICKERS: The pantry herbs labels stickers are according to A from Z ordered listed, you can easily find out the spices you need, and organize your spices and herbs neatly and efficiently in the pantry, drawers or cabinets. This special material allows reusable and removable, they are perfect for first-timers as you can easily peel and stick and had no issue removing them. They would not leave any residue or adhesive. FITS FOR DIFFERENT SIZE SPICE JARS: GMISUN's minimalist spice labels size is 2.16x1.18in, is a perfect size for 2.5oz, 4oz, 6oz, 8oz, and other size spice jars. They provide a classy and stylish appearance on your spice jars or containers, which increases the sense of home aesthetic, and improves your aesthetic pleasure. In case you can not find the labels you want, we also offer blank spice labels for you to write on the sticker and customize your own labels. NO WORRY AFTER-SALE SERVICE: GMISUN aiming to provide customers with high-quality products and services. If you find any problems or improvements in the spice labels stickers during use, please contact us, we will solve the issues for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nSFplhHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B0BC31NNRT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC31NNRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC31NNRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
