window.products.push({"id":843963,"name":"Disney's Pirates of the Caribbean 3 Piece Table and Chair Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dk5fIL2CL._AC_.jpg","description":"You'll receive the Disney's Pirates of the Caribbean 3 Pc Table and Chair Set. This is brand new in retail box. As you can see from the picture Pirates all over it. Very comfortable and lightweight. Every table leg and both chairs have safety locks to prevent them from folding up. The dimensions of the table is 24\" x 24\" and 20\" high. Also, the table is VERY sturdy, once you have the legs locked, it's not falling down easily. Best of all this set includes 2 matching folding chairs. Each chair is 10½\" wide, 12\" deep, and 20\" high. Like said earlier the chairs have safety locks. These are also very sturdy and can easily fit almost any child. They also have seat and back cushioning for extra comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Dk5fIL2CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Disney","source_asin":"B0016LDO00","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-843963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0016LDO00","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0016LDO00","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
